<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Take Your Trading to the Next Level | The Saran Trader</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Learn about the mission, vision, and the professional expertise behind The Saran Trader. Our goal is to empower traders worldwide.">

    <!-- CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/output.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>

<body class="bg-brand-navy text-white font-sans antialiased">
    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_top', { pageTitle: 'About Us', wrapperBg: 'bg-brand-navy' }) %>

    <main id="main-content" class="<%= standardTopPadding %> pb-20">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center mb-20 animate-fade-in">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6">
                Empowering Traders with <span class="text-brand-gold italic">Precision</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                Yahan trading ko business mindset ke saath sikhaya jaata hai, gambling mindset ke saath nahi.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Our Story Section -->
        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mb-32">
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-brand-gold/10 bg-slate-900/50 p-2">
                        <img src="/images/about_us.jpeg" alt="Our Journey" class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl block">
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-gold rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center rotate-12 shadow-xl">
                        <span class="text-brand-navy text-4xl font-black">3+</span>
                        <span class="text-brand-navy text-xs font-bold block ml-1">Year<br>Exp.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold border-l-4 border-brand-gold pl-4">The Saran Trader Belief</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        The Saran Trader ka simple belief hai: <span class="text-brand-gold font-bold italic">Ek accha trade, 10 average trades se better hota hai.</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                        Trading mein maximum log loss isliye karte hain kyunki woh Overtrading karte hain, Emotions control nahi kar pate, aur Shortcut chahte hain. Hum inhi cheezon ko fix karne par focus karte hain.
                    </p>
                    <div class="pt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-brand-gold text-2xl font-bold">17k+</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Active Members</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-brand-gold text-2xl font-bold">95%</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Satisfaction Rate</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Core Values -->
        <section class="bg-white/5 py-24">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="text-center mb-16">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Our Core Values</h2>
                    <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-brand-gold mx-auto"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                    <!-- Value 1 -->
                    <div class="p-8 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-gold/50 transition-all group">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-umbrella text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Capital Protection</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Humara sabse pehla goal capital ko save karna hai. Paisa rahega tabhi trade hoga.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Value 2 -->
                    <div class="p-8 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-gold/50 transition-all group">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Mental Discipline</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Trading psychology 80% hoti hai. Emotions ko control karke hi consistency aati hai.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Value 3 -->
                    <div class="p-8 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-gold/50 transition-all group">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-infinity text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Long-term Consistency</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Hum raton-raat ameer banne mein nahi, balki mahine-dar-mahine profit banane mein vishwas rakhte hain.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA Section -->
        <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-32">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-gold to-brand-accent rounded-3xl p-12 text-center text-brand-navy shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/4 opacity-10">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chess-king text-[20rem]"></i>
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6">Ready to Start Your Journey?</h2>
                <p class="text-lg opacity-90 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
                    Join thousands of traders who have already transformed their approach with The Saran Trader.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="<%= links.platform.courses %>" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
                        Explore Courses
                    </a>
                    <a href="<%= links.platform.signup %>" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/20 text-brand-navy border border-brand-navy/20 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-white/30 transition-all">
                        Create Account
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_bottom') %>

    <script src="/javascripts/main.js" defer></script>
</body>

</html>
